flowchart

Start [icon: play] > Login [shape: diamond, icon: log-in]: User logged in?
Login > Auth [icon: user-plus]: No
Auth > Login: Login/Signup
Login > SelectEmp [icon: user]: Yes
SelectEmp > LoadTypes [icon: refresh]: Load Dynamic Attestation Types
LoadTypes > SelectType [icon: check-square]: Select Attestation Type
SelectType > Validate [shape: diamond, icon: check]: Valid selection?
Validate > Error1 [icon: x-circle]: No
Error1 > SelectType: Show error message
Validate > Generate [icon: file-plus]: Yes
Generate > GetTemplate [icon: file]: Get JRXML Template from DB
GetTemplate > TemplateExists [shape: diamond, icon: check]: Template exists?
TemplateExists > Error2 [icon: x-circle]: No
Error2 > SelectType: Template not found error
TemplateExists > CompileTemplate [icon: settings]: Yes
CompileTemplate > FillTemplate [icon: edit]: Fill template with employee data
FillTemplate > GeneratePDF [icon: file-text]: Generate PDF using JasperReports
GeneratePDF > SaveFile [icon: save]: Save PDF to file system
SaveFile > SaveRecord [icon: database]: Save attestation record to DB
SaveRecord > Success [icon: check-circle]: Show success notification
Success > Download [shape: diamond, icon: download]: Download PDF?
Download > DownloadFile [icon: download]: Yes
Download > End [icon: stop]: No
DownloadFile > End: Process complete

BugPath [color: red] {
  Error1 [icon: x-circle, color: red]
  Error2 [icon: x-circle, color: red]
}

SuccessPath [color: green] {
  Generate [icon: file-plus, color: green]
  CompileTemplate [icon: settings, color: green]
  FillTemplate [icon: edit, color: green]
  GeneratePDF [icon: file-text, color: green]
  Success [icon: check-circle, color: green]
}